stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> discover_servers
    discover_servers --> load_job: both servers expose required tools
    discover_servers --> [*]: missing server / tool (fatal)
    load_job --> list_resumes: candidate_db.get_job OK
    load_job --> [*]: unknown job (fatal)
    list_resumes --> batch_read: filesystem.list_files
    list_resumes --> [*]: folder missing (fatal)
    batch_read --> score_candidates: filesystem.batch_process(read)
    score_candidates --> assess_with_llm: LLM configured
    score_candidates --> rank_and_report: no LLM
    assess_with_llm --> rank_and_report: top-N notes written
    rank_and_report --> persist_results: filesystem.write_file(report)
    persist_results --> [*]: mode = once
    persist_results --> watch_for_resumes: mode = watch
    watch_for_resumes --> batch_read: created / modified (only the new files)
    watch_for_resumes --> rank_and_report: deleted (re-rank, remove_matches)
    watch_for_resumes --> watch_for_resumes: no events yet (long-poll again)
    watch_for_resumes --> [*]: watch window over (stop_watch)
